  "statements": [
    {
      "type": "Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions",
      "notes": "Suggested Use\nConsume one or more capsules daily or as recommended by your physician. As with any dietary supplement, this product is most effective as part of a healthy diet and active lifestyle, along with a daily multi-vitamin-mineral formula. For questions about the use of this product, call 800.332.7799."
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "Unsurpassed. \nPurity. Quality. Integrity. Effectiveness. \nAndrew Lessman \nFounder of ProCaps Labs\nHSN\nwww.HSN.com \n800.944.9999 \nwww.QVC.com\n800.345.1515\nQuestions? Call 800.800.1200\nwww.ProCapsLabs.com"
    },
    {
      "type": "Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)",
      "notes": "Copyright 2021 ProCaps Labs"
    },
    {
      "type": "Formulation re: Other",
      "notes": "Protected for optimum absorption"
    },
    {
      "type": "Formula re: Contains",
      "notes": "100 mcg vitamin B12\nHigh potency B-complex"
    },
    {
      "type": "FDA Statement of Identity",
      "notes": "Dietary Supplement"
    },
    {
      "type": "Formulation re: Other",
      "notes": "All-solar manufacturing"
    },
    {
      "type": "Formula re: Contains",
      "notes": "Andrew Lessman's Vitamin B12 100 delivers 100 mcg of our unique absorption-protected methylcobalamin (natural coenzyme vitamin B12) – the most important of all B vitamins to supplement. This importance stems from B12's long list of critical functions and the fact that its large molecular size makes it the most difficult of all vitamins to absorb. Vitamin B12 is essential for all energy production and the creation of hemoglobin, without which oxygen cannot be transported. We also cannot metabolize carbohydrates or burn fat without B12. Even more important is B12's vital role in the synthesis of our genetic material and its requirement for normal cell growth and development. B12 also supports heart health due to its ability to help metabolize homocysteine, and B12 is also essential to support healthy immune and nervous system function. B12's enormous molecular size makes it all but impossible to absorb from typical supplements, which are easily destroyed by stomach acid. It is also well-established that stress, aging and digestive issues only further reduce Vitamin B12's already poor absorption. Our unique Vitamin B12 is protected from stomach acid and releases its contents in the small intestine where it is absorbed making it the only intelligent and effective way to orally deliver B12's benefits. Given all the critical functions of Vitamin B12, along with its extremely poor absorption from food and ordinary supplements, we should all carefully consider a plan to intelligently supplement. Best of all, our Vitamin B12 100 is a pleasure to use, since it comes in a small, soft, easy-to-swallow capsule that is gentle even to the most sensitive stomachs."
    },
    {
      "type": "FDA Disclaimer Statement",
      "notes": "These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."
    },
    {
      "type": "Formulation re: Does NOT Contain",
      "notes": "Contains no milk, soy, yeast, corn, wheat, gluten, sodium, salt, sugar, fat, cholesterol, color, preservative, common allergens or manufacturing additives. \nContains no additives of any kind."
    }
